:0,\"totalVolume\":0,\"platformFees\":0},\"updatedAt\":1780547482437}\n=== /api/graph ===\n{\"nodes\":[{\"nodeId\":\"0x86ca8ea17820f5c1b4cd6778f9f1ce982f5ae1c00009dc4500df6180da3bcc57\",\"creator\":\"0xd300C861cD5B16b01270Dd53899Fd1d71a87223a\",\"fourRights\":{\"usage\":2,\"derive\":1,\"expand\":1,\"benefit\":1},\"timestamp\":1780060481,\"outDegree\":1,\"inDegree\":0,\"edges\":[{\"toNode\":\"0x16ce7aab3ddb2069adbda7a90173e4fbda5bdbe6026fddffc75c00c6bb0fe149\",\"depth\":1,\"declarer\":\"0xd300C861cD5B16b01270Dd53899Fd1d71a87223a\",\"edgeType\":0}],\"createdAtBlock\":2704467,\"txHash\":\"0x5ebf5dd388d6e34c5964ed437b3fcd1d649c8b21a3fd806ff0efdbac1902f616\",\"u\":0,\"d\":7874,\"e\":1,\"b\":0,\"quadrants\":{\"usage\":2,\"derive\":1,\"expand\":1,\"benefit\":1},\"potential\":1.39,\"potentialHistory\":[{\"timestamp\":1780316203202,\"potential\":1.36,\"phase\":0,\"block\":2704467},{\"timestamp\":1780316228303,\"potential\":1.36,\"phase\":0,\"block\":2704467},{\"timestamp\":1780316285464,\"potential\":1.36,\"phase\":0,\"block\":2704467},{\"timestamp\":1780316403781,\"potential\":1.36,\"phase\":0,\"block\":2704467},{\"timestamp\":1780316650025,\"potential\":1.36,\"phase\":0,\"block\":2704467},{\"timestamp\":1780316655046,\"potential\":1.36,\"phase\":0,\"block\":2704467},{\"timestamp\":1780316693582,\"potential\":1.36,\"phase\":0,\"block\":2704467},{\"timestamp\":1780316695470,\"potential\":1.36,\"phase\":0,\"block\":2704467},{\"timestamp\":1780316720914,\"potential\":1.36,\"phase\":0,\"block\":2704467},{\"timestamp\":1780316829925,\"potential\":1.36,\"phase\":0,\"block\":2704467},{\"timestamp\":1780316867981,\"potential\":1.36,\"phase\":0,\"block\":2704467},{\"timestamp\":1780316932158,\"potential\":1.36,\"phase\":0,\"block\":2704467},{\n=== /api/battles ===\n{\"battles\":[],\"total\":0,\"contract\":\"0xE4a161e8892aeA51f026dD4f2C7c7A3a855b5aD3\",\"updatedAt\":1780547512440}","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780547512527}}
{"type":"message","id":"ccdabc79","parentId":"63f3dcd6","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:32:01.318Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"清楚了。重要发现：\n\n1. **真有数据**：5 个节点、4 条边、1 个 round、0 战斗\n2. **`/api/milestones` 是空** — YuanPage 原本就是 demo 数据，没真实数据源\n3. **`/api/game/rounds` + `/api/game/round/:id`** — 这是 JingCompPage 该用的，**不是写死的 ranking**\n4. **节点带 `fourRights` + `quadrants`** — 势位榜数据从 nodes 聚合能算\n5. **字段统一了** — `nodeId`, `fourRights`, `edges[].toNode`, `potential` — JingPage 里的 `shiPosition` 是前端造的，**实际后端没有这个字段**\n\n先把 JingPage 的字段映射理清，再开始改。先看 indexer 里的 `phase` 来源："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_y7r7w8smihjw_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cd /home/node/.openclaw/workspace/outputs/echo-v2/backend && grep -n \"phase\\|shiPosition\" echo-indexer-p0.js | head -20"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":4661,"output":241,"cacheRead":50071,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":54973,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780547512535,"responseId":"067032b9c27def8dc25bf657930ece99"}}
