{"type":"message","id":"faa3b8b8","parentId":"ae4afdd1","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:32:09.735Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`phase` 存在节点上，但 `/api/nodes` 拿到的 snapshot 没显式返回这个字段（只返了 `phaseHistory` 里的 `phase`）。**这是 JingPage 兜底代码的来源**。\n\nOK，开始动手。先创建 schema/types、env 模板："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_959sp587zmde_1","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/outputs/echo-v2/.env.example","content":"# ECHO v2 Frontend Environment\n# Copy to .env.local for local dev. Production sets in Cloudflare Pages.\n\n# 后端 API base URL（不要带末尾斜杠）\nVITE_API_BASE=https://echo-api.meerfans.club\n\n# 当前 ECHO 协议版本（用于版本约束检查）\nVITE_ECHO_VERSION=1.1.0\n\n# 钱包默认链 ID\nVITE_CHAIN_ID=813\nVITE_CHAIN_NAME=Qitmeer Mainnet\n\n# RPC 节点（逗号分隔，前端选第一个可用）\nVITE_RPC_URLS=https://qng.rpc.qitmeer.io,https://rpc.dimai.ai,https://evm-dataseed1.meerscan.io,https://rpc.woowow.io\n"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":168,"output":274,"cacheRead":54959,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":55401,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780547521576,"responseId":"067032c250223814342701d0fe0fb652"}}
