{"type":"message","id":"998be432","parentId":"ad8bcc24","timestamp":"2026-06-04T04:38:59.207Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"全部 P0+P1 完成。\n\n---\n\n# 完工报告\n\n## 改动清单\n\n**新增文件（4）**\n- `src/contracts/types.js` — 单一真理源：`normalizeNode` / `normalizeEdges` / `normalizeRound` / `PHASE_NAMES` / `FOUR_SEALS`\n- `src/utils/api.js` — 统一 API 客户端（`apiGet` + 6 个端点封装 + `import.meta.env.VITE_API_BASE`）\n- `src/utils/runtimeConfig.js` — 读 env（ECHO_VERSION / CHAIN_ID / RPC_URLS）\n- `.env.example` / `.env.local` / `.env.production`\n\n**重写文件（6）**\n- `src/pages/JingPage.jsx` — 用归一化数据，删除所有 `JSON.stringify(...)` 防御代码\n- `src/pages/DianPage.jsx` — 接 `/api/nodes`+`/api/edges`，契印状态从 `fourRights` 反推，history 持久化到 localStorage（标\"已上链/本地\"）\n- `src/pages/YuanPage.jsx` — 著录=节点列表，源流谱=边列表，纪年=节点时间线。**全部从真数据来**\n- `src/pages/JingCompPage.jsx` — 接 `/api/game/rounds` + `/api/game/round/:id`，\"上下轮\"按钮接真数据，`disabled` 控制边界\n- `src/hooks/useWallet.js` — 切链重建 provider/signer；accountsChanged 用 ref 拿最新 address\n- `src/components/WalletBar.jsx` — 删了重复 useEffect，消费 `context.balance`\n\n## 验证\n\n```\n✅ vite build: 7.22s, 473.98 kB (gzip 163 kB)\n✅ esbuild 语法检查：12/12 文件通过\n✅ /api/health: 200 OK (5 nodes, 4 edges, 1 round, 0 bets)\n```\n\n## 解决的关键问题\n\n| 问题 | 修复 |\n|:--|:--|\n| 4 个页面有 3 个是死数据 | Dian/Yuan/JingComp 全部接真 API |\n| 字段名漂移（`potential` vs `potentialValue`，`phase` vs `shiPosition`） | `normalizeNode` 归一化，前端只用 NormalizedNode |\n| 切链后旧 provider 还在用 | `chainChanged` 重建 provider/signer |\n| 监听器闭包拿旧 address | 用 `useRef` 跟踪最新值 |\n| 契印谱刷新就丢 | localStorage 持久化（最多 50 条） |\n| `API_BASE` 硬编码 | 走 `VITE_API_BASE`，配 `.env.example` |\n| WalletBar 重复拉余额 | 直接消费 `useWalletContext().balance` |\n\n## 还能继续做的（不在 P0/P1，留给下一轮）\n\n- **React Query / SWR** — 现在每个 page 独立 useEffect 拉数据，切页面再回来又重新请求。需要全局缓存层\n- **错误处理统一** — 各页自己 try/catch 显示错误，应该有 `ErrorToast` + 全局 ErrorContext\n- **落印真上链** — DianPage 的 `handleSave` 现在只写 localStorage，要等 `LicenseNFT.mint` 接口稳定\n- **JingPage 心电图换库** — 裸 Canvas 60 行够用，但加 tooltip/动画就吃力了\n- **DianPage 重光印的语义** — `reproduce` 字段不在后端 `fourRights` 四项里，目前映射到 `benefit`，要跟猫先森确认\n\n## 部署注意\n\n- `dist/` 已重新构建\n- 部署到 Cloudflare Pages 需在 dashboard 配 `VITE_API_BASE=https://echo-api.meerfans.club`（或直接用 `.env.production`）\n- 后端目前 1 个 round、0 押注——demo 数据稀薄，JingComp 看着会冷清。要不要我顺手用 `useCase.js` 那套 `juryCommit` 造点测试数据？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":33,"output":887,"cacheRead":77414,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":78334,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780547915853,"responseId":"0670344c342fea2a4222a4d46b4b1b5c"}}
{"type":"message","id":"f339580d","parentId":"998be432","timestamp":"2026-06-04T14:14:03.428Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"user:ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b6d2ccc9fd4a8b4cd2366fd74e3f\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Thu 2026-06-04 14:13 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b6d2ccc9fd4a8b4cd2366fd74e3f]\nou_f786171f9e21bf5a09c3116b2e77aaff: https://yio5us4oqe.feishu.cn/wiki/M2t4wcL7TiQkoRkMLx7cj8arnCM?from=from_copylink"}],"timestamp":1780582443392}}
{"type":"message","id":"ea2f1217","parentId":"f339580d","timestamp":"2026-06-04T14:14:18.232Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这是飞书 wiki 链接，要先看看到底是什么内容。"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_qwlid4zm5r8j_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"node -e \"\nconst https = require('https');\nconst fs = require('fs');\nconst cfg = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('/home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json','utf-8'));\nconst secret = cfg.channels.feishu.accounts.main.appSecret;\nconst body = JSON.stringify({app_id:'cli_aa8198b425389cef', app_secret: secret});\nconst opts = {hostname:'open.feishu.cn', path:'/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal', method:'POST', headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json','Content-Length':body.length}};\nconst req = https.request(opts, res => { let d=''; res.on('data',c=>d+=c); res.on('end',()=>{ const t=JSON.parse(d).tenant_access_token; resolveNode(t); }); });\nreq.write(body); req.end();\n\nfunction resolveNode(token) {\n  const url = 'https://open.feishu.cn/open-apis/wiki/v2/nodes/M2t4wcL7TiQkoRkMLx7cj8arnCM';\n  https.get(url, {headers:{Authorization:'***'+token}}, res => {\n    let d=''; res.on('data',c=>d+=c); res.on('end',()=>{ console.log('NODE:', d); });\n  });\n}\n\" 2>&1 | head -20"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":78748,"output":326,"cacheRead":114,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":79188,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780582443488,"responseId":"0670bb2c4a3c3d9bf99b9f1597ac5009"}}
