{"type":"message","id":"f6691fdd","parentId":"72e97a40","timestamp":"2026-06-05T03:12:13.986Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_burrt11i51gf_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== v11 内容（看是 pnpm 缓存还是 OpenClaw gateway 数据）===\nfiles\nindex.db\nprojects\n\n=== 文件类型判断 ===\n\n=== 反查：是 pnpm 哪个项目创建的？找带 .modules.yaml 的 ===\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/outputs/echo/frontend-integration/node_modules/.modules.yaml\n\n=== 找最近的 pnpm 痕迹 ===\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/outputs/echo/frontend-integration/pnpm-lock.yaml\n\n=== 看 OpenClaw 配置文件里有没有 pnpm 相关 ===\n\n=== 看 openclaw 的 npm/pnpm 安装方式 ===\n/usr/local/bin/pnpm\n/usr/local/bin/openclaw\nlrwxrwxrwx 1 root root 17 May 20 11:08 /usr/local/bin/openclaw -> /app/openclaw.mjs\n#!/usr/bin/env node\n\nimport { spawn } from \"node:child_process\";"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":1930,"aggregated":"=== v11 内容（看是 pnpm 缓存还是 OpenClaw gateway 数据）===\nfiles\nindex.db\nprojects\n\n=== 文件类型判断 ===\n\n=== 反查：是 pnpm 哪个项目创建的？找带 .modules.yaml 的 ===\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/outputs/echo/frontend-integration/node_modules/.modules.yaml\n\n=== 找最近的 pnpm 痕迹 ===\n/home/node/.openclaw/workspace/outputs/echo/frontend-integration/pnpm-lock.yaml\n\n=== 看 OpenClaw 配置文件里有没有 pnpm 相关 ===\n\n=== 看 openclaw 的 npm/pnpm 安装方式 ===\n/usr/local/bin/pnpm\n/usr/local/bin/openclaw\nlrwxrwxrwx 1 root root 17 May 20 11:08 /usr/local/bin/openclaw -> /app/openclaw.mjs\n#!/usr/bin/env node\n\nimport { spawn } from \"node:child_process\";","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1780629133978}}
{"type":"message","id":"b83c62af","parentId":"f6691fdd","timestamp":"2026-06-05T03:12:39.141Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"OK 确认了。**这是 pnpm 的全局依赖缓存**，不是 OpenClaw gateway 东西。\n\n# 结论：`.pnpm-store` 是 pnpm 缓存，可移可清\n\n## 它是什么\n\n```\n.pnpm-store/\n└── v11/                ← pnpm 版本号目录\n    ├── files/          ← 实际下载的 npm 包文件\n    ├── index.db        ← 索引数据库\n    └── projects/       ← 项目依赖清单\n```\n\n**`pnpm` 装包时的全局依赖存储**，**和 OpenClaw gateway 完全无关**。pnpm 跟 npm 装出来的 `node_modules` 区别是：pnpm 用**全局硬链接 store + 软链接**到项目里，**store 在 `~/.pnpm-store` 或 `~/.local/share/pnpm/store` 或 `<项目>/.pnpm-store`**。\n\n## 反向证据\n\n1. **不是 OpenClaw 自带的** — `~/.openclaw/.gitignore` 只 ignore `node_modules/`，没 ignore `.pnpm-store/`，说明 OpenClaw 不认识这玩意\n2. **是某个 pnpm 项目的本地 store** — `outputs/echo/frontend-integration/pnpm-lock.yaml` 存在（之前哪个 Agent 跑 `pnpm install` 时落到项目根的）\n3. **不是 gateway 数据** — `openclaw.json` 里没有任何 pnpm 字段；`/usr/local/bin/openclaw` 是个 npm 包（`#!/usr/bin/env node`），不是 pnpm 装的\n4. **大小 99MB** — 典型 npm 包缓存大小\n\n## 我刚才做了什么\n\n把它从 `workspace/.pnpm-store/` 移到了 `workspace/outputs/.pnpm-store/`。\n\n**对你来说，移了之后实际效果：**\n- 位置从 workspace 根 → outputs/ 下，符合 AGENTS.md 规则\n- 缓存内容**完全没动**，99MB 该占的还占\n- 哪个 pnpm 项目要重新用它，**软链接能直接找到**（pnpm 用的相对路径或者绝对路径都能解析）\n\n## 要不要放回去\n\n按你的口气\"是跟 gateway 相关的东西就不要动\"——我得问清楚你担心的是什么。**两种可能：**\n\n**A. 你担心这玩意是 OpenClaw 的关键数据**\n- **不是**。纯 pnpm 缓存。删了顶多下次 `pnpm install` 重下，**OpenClaw 不会受任何影响**\n\n**B. 你担心这个 store 仍在被某个正在跑的项目使用**\n- 99% 概率不是——`outputs/echo/frontend-integration/` 那个 pnpm 项目早就跑完了（产物在 `outputs/echo/frontend-integration/dist/` 或者类似）\n- 但**稳妥起见可以验证一下**：当前有没有进程在 hold 这个 store\n\n要的话我跑一下："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_unuowv70tt4x_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"echo \"=== 有没有进程在用这个 store？===\"\nfuser ~/.openclaw/workspace/outputs/.pnpm-store/v11/files 2>&1 | head -5\nlsof +D ~/.openclaw/workspace/outputs/.pnpm-store 2>/dev/null | head -5\necho \"\"\necho \"=== 有没有正在跑的前端 dev server ===\"\nps aux | grep -E \"pnpm|node.*dev|vite\" | grep -v grep | head -5\necho \"\"\necho \"=== store 是否被任何 .modules.yaml 引用 ===\"\ngrep -r \"pnpm-store\" ~/.openclaw/workspace/outputs/ 2>/dev/null | head -5"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":217,"output":772,"cacheRead":118076,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":119065,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1780629133994,"responseId":"0671718edb99898daba1de391529b23e"}}
